      <% const accordionData=[ { title: "By the time my bot detects a price gap, it's already gone..." ,
        content: "We build bots with an architecture with direct WebSocket feeds to act under in 50 milliseconds." }, {
        title: "I want my bot to work on Binance, OKX, and Kraken at the same time..." ,
        content: "Yes. Our bots come with pre-built API connectors for 50+ centralized and decentralized exchanges." },
        { title: "What happens if the bot places a trade and the price moves against me mid-execution?" ,
        content: "We add real-time slippage detection and auto-cancel logic. If the net profit drops below your set threshold, the bot aborts the order automatically."
        }, { title: "Gas fees on DeFi are killing my profits - how do bots handle this?" ,
        content: "Our DeFi arbitrage bots calculate total trade cost before placing any order, and only execute when it is profitable."
        }, { title: "I don't have a development team - how do I manage the bot after it's live?" ,
        content: "Every Clarisco bot comes with a monitoring dashboard, performance reports, and our maintenance team handles all technical operations."
        }, { title: "What if market conditions change and my bot's strategy stops working?" ,
        content: "We build strategy-switching logic into the bot. It automatically adjusts based on real-time market conditions."
        }, { title: "How do I know if the bot is actually making money or just trading in circles?" ,
        content: "Our admin dashboard shows live P&L tracking, trade history, profit per pair, fee breakdown, and ROI reports."
        } ]; %>

